    <title></title>
    <link href="/2025/10/25/use-gpg-on-debian12/"/>
    <url>/2025/10/25/use-gpg-on-debian12/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="Generate-key"><a href="#Generate-key" class="headerlink" title="Generate key"></a>Generate key</h2><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">xiaozekai@debian:~$ gpg --generate-key <br>gpg (GnuPG) 2.2.40; Copyright (C) 2022 g10 Code GmbH<br>This is free software: you are free to change and redistribute it.<br>There is NO WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law.<br><br>注意：使用 “gpg --full-generate-key” 以获得一个全功能的密钥生成对话框。<br><br>GnuPG 需要构建用户标识以辨认您的密钥。<br><br>真实姓名： xiaozekai<br>电子邮件地址： hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com<br>您选定了此用户标识：<br>    “xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;”<br><br>更改姓名（N）、注释（C）、电子邮件地址（E）或确定（O）/退出（Q）？ O<br>我们需要生成大量的随机字节。在质数生成期间做些其他操作（敲打键盘<br>、移动鼠标、读写硬盘之类的）将会是一个不错的主意；这会让随机数<br>发生器有更好的机会获得足够的熵。<br>我们需要生成大量的随机字节。在质数生成期间做些其他操作（敲打键盘<br>、移动鼠标、读写硬盘之类的）将会是一个不错的主意；这会让随机数<br>发生器有更好的机会获得足够的熵。<br>gpg: 目录‘/home/xiaozekai/.gnupg/openpgp-revocs.d’已创建<br>gpg: 吊销证书已被存储为‘/home/xiaozekai/.gnupg/openpgp-revocs.d/16DC810DED57D715BA32940ED39503E7EA09228C.rev’<br>公钥和私钥已经生成并被签名。<br><br>pub   rsa3072 2025-10-05 [SC] [有效至：2027-10-05]<br>      16DC810DED57D715BA32940ED39503E7EA09228C<br>uid                      xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;<br>sub   rsa3072 2025-10-05 [E] [有效至：2027-10-05]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>上面的命令中：</p><ol><li>加解密&#x2F;签名认证使用的算法都默认是RSA</li><li>RSA密钥的长度默认是3072个比特位</li><li>密钥的有效期默认是2年</li></ol><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">xiaozekai@debian:~$ gpg --full-generate-key <br>gpg (GnuPG) 2.2.40; Copyright (C) 2022 g10 Code GmbH<br>This is free software: you are free to change and redistribute it.<br>There is NO WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law.<br><br>请选择您要使用的密钥类型：<br>   (1) RSA 和 RSA （默认）<br>   (2) DSA 和 Elgamal<br>   (3) DSA（仅用于签名）<br>   (4) RSA（仅用于签名）<br> （14）卡中现有密钥<br>您的选择是？ 1<br>RSA 密钥的长度应在 1024 位与 4096 位之间。<br>您想要使用的密钥长度？(3072) 4096<br>请求的密钥长度是 4096 位<br>请设定这个密钥的有效期限。<br>         0 = 密钥永不过期<br>      &lt;n&gt;  = 密钥在 n 天后过期<br>      &lt;n&gt;w = 密钥在 n 周后过期<br>      &lt;n&gt;m = 密钥在 n 月后过期<br>      &lt;n&gt;y = 密钥在 n 年后过期<br>密钥的有效期限是？(0) 0<br>密钥永远不会过期<br>这些内容正确吗？ (y/N) y<br><br>GnuPG 需要构建用户标识以辨认您的密钥。<br><br>真实姓名： xiaozekai<br>电子邮件地址： hstc.xiaozekai@debian.com<br>注释： <br>您选定了此用户标识：<br>    “xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@debian.com&gt;”<br><br>更改姓名（N）、注释（C）、电子邮件地址（E）或确定（O）/退出（Q）？ O<br>我们需要生成大量的随机字节。在质数生成期间做些其他操作（敲打键盘<br>、移动鼠标、读写硬盘之类的）将会是一个不错的主意；这会让随机数<br>发生器有更好的机会获得足够的熵。<br>我们需要生成大量的随机字节。在质数生成期间做些其他操作（敲打键盘<br>、移动鼠标、读写硬盘之类的）将会是一个不错的主意；这会让随机数<br>发生器有更好的机会获得足够的熵。<br>gpg: 吊销证书已被存储为‘/home/xiaozekai/.gnupg/openpgp-revocs.d/BB2191BE041BAE8178A283CDA27BDA42A112E26E.rev’<br>公钥和私钥已经生成并被签名。<br><br>pub   rsa4096 2025-10-05 [SC]<br>      BB2191BE041BAE8178A283CDA27BDA42A112E26E<br>uid                      xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@debian.com&gt;<br>sub   rsa4096 2025-10-05 [E]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>上面的命令中：</p><ol><li>用户可以选择使用何种算法进行加解密&#x2F;签名认证</li><li>用户可以选择密钥的长度</li><li>用户可以选择密钥的有效期</li></ol><h2 id="Encrypt-and-Decrypt"><a href="#Encrypt-and-Decrypt" class="headerlink" title="Encrypt and Decrypt"></a>Encrypt and Decrypt</h2><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell"><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">发给谁，就用谁的加密密钥进行加密</span><br>gpg --recipient &quot;xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&quot; --output test-encrypt.txt --encrypt test.txt<br><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">接受到密文后，用自己的解密密钥进行解密</span><br>gpg --output test-decrypt.txt --decrypt test-encrypt.txt<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="Import-and-Export"><a href="#Import-and-Export" class="headerlink" title="Import and Export"></a>Import and Export</h2><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell"><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span></span><br>gpg --export -a &quot;xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;&quot; &gt; publickey.asc<br>gpg --export-secret-keys -a &quot;xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;&quot; &gt; privatekey.asc<br><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"></span><br><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">import</span><br>gpg --import privatekey.asc<br>gpg --import publickey.asc<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="Delete-Key"><a href="#Delete-Key" class="headerlink" title="Delete Key"></a>Delete Key</h2><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell"><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">先删除私钥，后删除公钥（以私废公）</span><br>gpg --delete-secret-keys &quot;xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;&quot;<br>gpg --delete-keys &quot;xiaozekai &lt;hstc.xiaozekai@gpg.com&gt;&quot;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="List-Key"><a href="#List-Key" class="headerlink" title="List Key"></a>List Key</h2><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell"><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">list public key</span><br>gpg --list-keys<br><span class="hljs-meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">list private key</span><br>gpg --list-secret-keys<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
